    oe:answerText "To evaluate the efficacy and safety of oral zuranolone for 14 days, compared with placebo, in Japanese patients with major depressive disorder (MDD). This multicenter, Phase 3 study was conducted in two parts (70 sites; Japan) including a randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled, parallel-group part presented herein."^^xsd:string ;
